#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/servicenow_flows.rst:12
msgid ""
"|morpheus| supports two types of ServiceNow automation for approval "
"workflows: **Workflows** (legacy) and **Flows** (modern). ServiceNow Flows "
"are the newer automation engine in ServiceNow (Flow Designer) that provides "
"a more modern, visual interface compared to traditional ServiceNow "
"Workflows."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| supports two types of ServiceNow automation para approval "
"workflows: **Workflows** (legacy) y **Flows** (modern). ServiceNow Flows son"
" el newer automation engine in ServiceNow (Flow Designer) que provides un "
"más modern, visual interfaz compared to traditional ServiceNow Workflows."

#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/servicenow_flows.rst:14
msgid ""
"When configuring approval policies in |morpheus|, you can select either a "
"synced Workflow or a synced Flow as the approval automation to trigger in "
"ServiceNow."
msgstr ""
"When configuring approval policies in |morpheus|, you puede select either un"
" synced Workflow o un synced Flow as el approval automation to trigger in "
"ServiceNow."

